msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And I told you we were getting impatient."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And I won"
msgstr "Und ich habe gewonnen"

msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "And I'm going to watch you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And I'm talking about you, Zoey Madison. I know you have it in you. Just think about it before you pawn that thing off to the Cartel."
msgstr "Und ich rede von dir, Zoey Madison. Ich weiß, du hast es in dir. Denk nur darüber nach, bevor du das Ding ans Kartell verscherbelst."

msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "And about earlier... I uh... Sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And at the Glowing Hole, we keep that promise."
msgstr "Und im Glowing Hole halten wir dieses Versprechen."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And at this point I feel like he's been picked up by those religious zealots that strut around town."
msgstr "Und langsam glaube ich, dass ihn diese religiösen Fanatiker aufgegabelt haben, die in der Stadt herumstolzieren."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And besides.. The tips really make for some sweet extra more often than not!~"
msgstr "Und außerdem.. Das Trinkgeld gibt meistens einen süßen Extra-Bonus!~"

msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "And don't forget about my offer, hehe."
msgstr "Und vergiss mein Angebot nicht, hehe."

msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "And done! Eheh. Sorry you had to see that, Zoey."
msgstr "Und fertig! Eheh. Tut mir leid, dass du das sehen musstest, Zoey."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And here, I've got your device ready. I modified a custom dildo I was working on. Attached a Neo-Faraday cage at the tip."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And hey- Uh... You shouldn't have to feel... scared to be seen either. Just saying. I get it too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And hurry up, I don't have all day."
msgstr "Und beeil dich, ich habe nicht den ganzen Tag Zeit."

msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "And if you don't, you're screwed. Ugh. Fuck me, alright Zoey. Just lemme see what I can do. Give me a minute."
msgstr "Und wenn nicht, bist du am Arsch. Ugh. Fuck, okay Zoey. Lass mich einfach schauen, was ich tun kann. Gib mir eine Minute."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And it'd take me fucking months of work to afford that."
msgstr "Und ich bräuchte verdammte Monate Arbeit, um mir das leisten zu können."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And it's really not extra?"
msgstr "Und es kostet wirklich nicht extra?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And just like the surrounding wasteland"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And let us hear yours~"
msgstr "Und lass uns deins hören~"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And miss out on this rare bit of free time with my bestie? I can afford being late for you, Z!"
msgstr "Und diese seltene freie Zeit mit meiner Besten verpassen? Für dich kann ich mir Verspätung leisten, Z!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And next time you'll help me think of something fun we can do together."
msgstr "Und nächstes Mal hilfst du mir, uns etwas Lustiges auszudenken, das wir zusammen machen können."

msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "And now you need me to make a fake of it? Why?"
msgstr "Und jetzt brauchst du von mir eine Fälschung davon? Warum?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And she didn't even take it. Just get outa here, girl."
msgstr "Und sie hat es nicht mal genommen. Hau einfach ab, Mädchen."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And since I don't imagine you can actually pay me for the work, I need you to take these while I fix up your little gadget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And so has she~"
msgstr "Und sie auch~"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And that got him thrown out?"
msgstr "Und deswegen ist er rausgeflogen?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And that was enough to get you thrown out?"
msgstr "Und das hat gereicht, um dich rauszuwerfen?"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And that would be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And the drone was recording?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And the purple stuff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And then Zoey said, let there be light... bridge."
msgstr "Und dann sagte Zoey, es werde Licht... Brücke."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And there are these ancient spirits heading here that are evil, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And they go after the citizens for loitering... So hypocritical..."
msgstr "Und sie gehen gegen Bürger wegen Herumlungerns vor... So heuchlerisch..."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And those stinking guards haven't even noticed us yet!"
msgstr "Und diese stinkenden Wachen haben uns noch nicht mal bemerkt!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And time for you to make new memories too, Leona."
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>And um... some... other things...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And um... some... other things..."
msgstr "Und ähm... einige... andere Dinge..."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And we didn't leave?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And we haven't watched them yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And we just wanted to get a closer look at your little kitty here, Leona. What was her name? Felicia?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "And when yah' done, gimme a good sniff of ya nasty little asshole, ahaha! 'Pay whaeva tip ya want, ahaha!"
msgstr "Und wenn du feddich bischt, lass mich mal kräftig an deinem ekligen kleinen Arschloch schnüffeln, ahaha! Zahl, waschde an Trinkgeld willscht, ahaha!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And where do you think you are going?"
msgstr "Und wo glaubst du, dass du hingehst?"

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And where do you think you're going?!"
msgstr "Und wo glaubst du, dass du hingehst?!"

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And where is Mynx anyways?!"
msgstr "Und wo ist Mynx überhaupt?!"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And where is this contact?"
msgstr "Und wo ist dieser Kontakt?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And where the fuck do you think you're going, huh?"
msgstr "Und wo zum Fick glaubst du, dass du hingehst, hä?"

msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "And who is this? Some online girlfriend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And who would that be?"
msgstr "Und wer wäre das?"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And without your fB card... you..."
msgstr "Und ohne deine fB-Karte... du..."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And yet it still looks better than anything I could put together."
msgstr "Und trotzdem sieht es besser aus als alles, was ich hinkriegen würde."

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And yet, here you are. Posing for me like a good little bunny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And yet, you can still see it in her eyes.. The unease. The taboo she was all so scared of. She"
msgstr "Und doch kannst du es noch in ihren Augen sehen.. Die Unruhe. Das Tabu, vor dem sie solche Angst hatte. Sie"

msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "And yet... I might part with ten more fuckbucks if you revealed your bare chest to me."
msgstr "Und doch... ich würde mich von zehn weiteren Fuckbucks trennen, wenn du mir deine nackte Brust zeigst."

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And you don't know how to open it?"
msgstr "Und du weißt nicht, wie man es öffnet?"

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And you obeyed. That's good. Let that reality sink into your bones. You can lie to yourself all you like, but I see that hunger in you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And you really think you're any better than them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And you're Zoey. The new waitress, hmm? Didn't we get interrupted while I was showing you the... ropes... recently?"
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <size=23>And you're forgetting to behave like a decent human being...
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And you're forgetting to behave like a decent human being..."
msgstr "Und du vergisst, dich wie ein anständiger Mensch zu benehmen..."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And you're gonna watch~"
msgstr "Und du wirst zuschauen~"

