msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If I do what you say, you won't rat me out... Right?"
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: If I don't hear any complaints about you from our customers, maybe I'll let you talk to Nova afterall, <i>Madison</i>.
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "If I don't hear any complaints about you from our customers, maybe I'll let you talk to Nova afterall, Madison."
msgstr "Wenn ich keine Beschwerden über dich von unseren Kunden höre, lasse ich dich vielleicht doch mit Nova reden, Madison."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If he got a picture of my boobs instead?"
msgstr "Wenn er stattdessen ein Bild von meinen Titten bekommen hätte?"

#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>If it helps, maybe talk to a service bunny. I'll be around too but I've got to hand out some drinks to other customers.</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "If it helps, maybe talk to a service bunny. I'll be around too but I've got to hand out some drinks to other customers."
msgstr "Wenn es hilft, rede vielleicht mit einem Service-Bunny. Ich bin auch da, aber ich muss anderen Kunden Drinks bringen."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If it is not, you"
msgstr "Wenn es nicht ist, du"

#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>If it isn't my most annoying customer...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "If it isn't my most annoying customer..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "If it isn't my new favorite bunny... Come have a seat. Right here. My hands ache for your... company."
msgstr "Wenn du nicht mein neues Lieblingsbunny bist... Komm setz dich. Genau hier. Meine Hände sehnen sich nach deiner... Gesellschaft."

msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "If it isn't the fat ass bunny bitch waitress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "If it weren't for what's left of my manners, my hands would be all over your chest, waitress..."
msgstr "Wenn ich nicht den Rest meiner Manieren hätte, wären meine Hände überall auf deiner Brust, Kellnerin..."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If no one's coming to save us then... we just gotta look out for each other, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If only I had the blocker back then... ugh- Come on, Zoey."
msgstr "Wenn ich damals nur den Blocker gehabt hätte... ugh- Komm, Zoey."

#. rich_text: <size=27>If the idea wasn't turning you on, you wouldn't have come back here.
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If the idea wasn't turning you on, you wouldn't have come back here."
msgstr "Wenn dich die Idee nicht anmachen würde, wärst du nicht hierher zurückgekommen."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If they look for Cypher right now, all they'll see she's trying on new disguises at the Un/ZIP store down by the Vermillion Plaza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If what you're saying is true, I'm really sorry about your girlfriend, but this can't be the right way!"
msgstr "Wenn das, was du sagst, wahr ist, tut mir deine Freundin wirklich leid, aber das kann nicht der richtige Weg sein!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If you"
msgstr "Wenn du"

#. rich_text: If you can't pay, then you can't live in that place. I don't care if you're buddy buddy with the mayor's daughter. Obviously you aren't buddy enough to mooch off her anymore. <b>Get me my damn fuckbucks.</b>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If you can't pay, then you can't live in that place. I don't care if you're buddy buddy with the mayor's daughter. Obviously you aren't buddy enough to mooch off her anymore. Get me my damn fuckbucks."
msgstr "Wenn du nicht zahlen kannst, dann kannst du nicht in diesem Laden wohnen. Mir ist egal, ob du mit der Bürgermeistertochter befreundet bist. Offensichtlich bist du nicht genug befreundet, um dich weiter durchzuschnorren. Besorg mir meine verdammten Fuckbucks."

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "If you have the right friends, replacing your body parts can lead to more than shiny looks.~"
msgstr "Wenn du die richtigen Freunde hast, kann das Ersetzen deiner Körperteile zu mehr als nur glänzendem Aussehen führen.~"

msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "If you let me snatch a pic of you, hottie, I'll get you a lil tip, ehehe *hic*."
msgstr "Wenn du mich ein Foto von dir machen lässt, Hübsche, geb ich dir ein kleines Trinkgeld, ehehe *hicks*."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If you say so, Z!"
msgstr "Wenn du das sagst, Z!"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr "Wenn du das sagst."

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "If you say so... Could definitely use some of that right now."
msgstr "Wenn du das sagst... Könnte gerade etwas davon gebrauchen."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If you think so... I'm glad, Sarah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If you want to cum, tell me that you're a slut."
msgstr "Wenn du kommen willst, sag mir, dass du eine Schlampe bist."

#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>If you want... I could... Turn around too...</color>
