msgid "If you want... I could... Turn around too..."
msgstr "Wenn du willst... könnte ich... mich auch umdrehen..."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "If you wanted some perversion, you could've just asked~"
msgstr "Wenn du Perversion wolltest, hättest du nur fragen müssen~"

#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>If you're not quite sure these pics are cutting it, maybe you could... like... go a step further.</color>
