msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uggh! I really want long nails, but my girlfriend wants me to keep them short for... reasons... Ahh, the things I do for love..."
msgstr "Uggh! Ich will wirklich lange Nägel, aber meine Freundin will, dass ich sie kurz halte, aus... Gründen... Ahh, was ich alles aus Liebe tue..."

msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Ugh fine... Move your ass up and down then, bitch. Give me a nice show!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh! Asshole!"
msgstr "Ugh! Arschloch!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh! Dream on. Are we done here?!"
msgstr "Ugh! Träum weiter. Sind wir hier fertig?!"

msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Ugh, FUCK you're hot, ahaha! Go fetch me a drink now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Ugh, fine. I'll just spread your pretty asshole then, bitch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh, just thinking about it makes my skin crawl. Come on, let's just keep unpacking, Z."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh. Same old, same old. Working for GAG is such a damn slog. Not like I want to work for them, but try telling your dad \"no\" when he's the fucking mayor."
msgstr "Ugh. Immer das Gleiche. Für GAG zu arbeiten ist so ein verdammter Mist. Nicht, dass ich für sie arbeiten will, aber versuch mal, deinem Dad „nein“ zu sagen, wenn er der scheiß Bürgermeister ist."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh. What the heck! These guys are blocking the way."
msgstr "Ugh. Was zum Teufel! Diese Typen blockieren den Weg."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... Alright. I'll try."
msgstr "Ugh... Na gut. Ich versuche es."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... And what am I supposed to do about the Cartel?"
msgstr "Ugh... Und was soll ich wegen des Kartells tun?"

msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Ugh... But you're just not happy like this, are you? Even with how hard I try to pamper you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Ugh... Felicia must've wandered home while those idiots were harassing us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... It's still warm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... No, that's not it."
msgstr "Ugh... Nein, das ist es nicht."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... Sorry. I didn't mean to be an asshole."
msgstr "Ugh... Sorry. Ich wollte kein Arschloch sein."

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Ugh... Yes... Sir..."
msgstr "Ugh... Ja... Sir..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Ughhh! But you're alwaaays busy! When you gonna make some time for your bestie, huh?"
msgstr "Ughhh! Aber du bist immeeer beschäftigt! Wann nimmst du dir mal Zeit für deine Beste, hm?"

