msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh huh."
msgstr "Mhm."

msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Uh huh. Zoey, dear. Get the lights please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Uh oh! Looks like this bucket of bolts ran out of juice! Shame."
msgstr "Oh oh! Sieht so aus, als wäre diesem Schrotthaufen der Saft ausgegangen! Schade."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh- I'd rather not go out there. Can I just... stay here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh- No- That's just- That's spare parts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh-.. Cal? Wait, what? Who's that?"
msgstr "Äh-.. Cal? Warte, was? Wer ist das?"

#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Uh-... R-right!</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uh-... R-right!"
msgstr "Äh-... R-richtig!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh-Uhm... Ca-Can I put some clothes on before I answer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh. Yeah! Put those super spy skills to work!"
msgstr "Äh. Ja! Setz diese Super-Spion-Fähigkeiten ein!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... *hic* sorry"
msgstr "Äh... *hick* Entschuldigung"

msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Uh... Alright."
msgstr "Äh... Na gut."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... Calliach? Where are ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... How are we gonna get out of here?"
msgstr "Äh... Wie kommen wir hier raus?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... Sorry, Jaime. I didn't mean to offend."
msgstr "Äh... Sorry, Jaime. Ich wollte dich nicht beleidigen."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... What are you gonna sleep on when you head home? Isn't this your bed, Sarah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uh... Yeah. No problem, Jaime. Talk later?"
msgstr "Äh... Ja. Kein Problem, Jaime. Reden wir später?"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uh... Yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... what's that picture on your screen?"
msgstr "Äh... was ist das für ein Bild auf deinem Bildschirm?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh33s?ff"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "UhC?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh, okay-..! Sweet drink, huh?"
msgstr "Ähh, okay-..! Süßes Getränk, hm?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh- Okay. I trust you! If you find my phone, I'll give you some fuckbucks for your troubles."
msgstr "Ähh- Okay. Ich vertraue dir! Wenn du mein Handy findest, gebe ich dir ein paar Fickdollar für deine Mühe."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh- Seen who?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh- Yeah! I can help if you want."
msgstr "Ähh- Ja! Ich kann helfen, wenn du willst."

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhh- here doggy! Get the bone!"
msgstr "Ähh- hier, Hündchen! Hol den Knochen!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh-! Nice tentacles!"
msgstr "Ähh-! Geile Tentakel!"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh-! What... kinda price?"
msgstr "Ähh-! Was... für ein Preis?"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhh..."
msgstr "Ähh..."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Are you okay, Exxy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Hey. Are you alright?"
msgstr "Ähh... Hey. Geht es dir gut?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... I can hear you two, you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... What are we doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... What's this for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Where's Lio again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Where's what?"
msgstr "Ähh... Wo ist was?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Yeah! We're okay! The box went crazy on us."
msgstr "Ähh... Ja! Uns geht es gut! Die Kiste ist durchgedreht."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... You wouldn't happen to have something that could help recharge an andro would you?"
msgstr "Ähh... Du hättest nicht zufällig etwas, womit man einen Andro aufladen könnte, oder?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... how are you gonna do that?"
msgstr "Ähh... wie willst du das machen?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh! No! No one! She's my uh-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh, Z. Look behind you."
msgstr "Ähhh, Z. Schau hinter dich."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh, something like that! Oh- I gotta go, let me know once you're close."
msgstr "Ähhh, so was in der Art! Oh- Ich muss los, sag mir Bescheid, wenn du in der Nähe bist."

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhhh- Soon? I really gotta go-"
msgstr "Ähhh- Bald? Ich muss wirklich los-"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh- so far none! Still working on retention."
msgstr "Ähhh- bisher keine! Arbeite noch an der Bindung."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh. You doing okay, buddy?"
msgstr "Ähhh. Geht es dir gut, Kumpel?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... Hello? Is this place open?"
msgstr "Ähhh... Hallo? Ist hier geöffnet?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... I have no idea how this thing works..."
msgstr "Ähhh... Ich habe keine Ahnung, wie dieses Ding funktioniert..."

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhhh... I'm not taking anyone!"
msgstr "Ähhh... Ich nehme niemanden mit!"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhhh... Okay Lio, I've got another key. Here goes nothing."
msgstr "Ähhh... Okay Lio, ich habe noch einen Schlüssel. Auf gut Glück."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... Okay?"
msgstr "Ähhh... Okay?"

